	<logo>https://static.globalissues.org/i/globalissues/logo-feed.jpg</logo><entry><id>https://www.globalissues.org/news/2026/11/25/44691</id><title>Will Bangladesh’s Islamists Reconcile with the Nation’s Cultural Identity?</title><updated>2026-11-25T16:23:43-08:00</updated><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://www.globalissues.org/news/2026/11/25/44691" /><media:thumbnail url="https://static.globalissues.org/ips/2024/01/Ehtesham-Shahid-100x100.jpg" width="100" height="100" /><summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;
DHAKA, Bangladesh, November 25 (IPS)  - Bangladesh has now been let down by two governments in a row. Sixteen years of Awami League rule ended in corruption and authoritarianism, and the BNP, returned to power, is behaving much as its predecessor did. The Islamist party presents itself as the clean alternative, yet many voters fear its views on women and its opposition to parts of Bengali culture. This essay argues that Bangladesh’s strength has always lain in its culture, &lt;em&gt;ex cultu robur&lt;/em&gt;, and that the Islamist party’s future depends on whether it can make peace with that inheritance.
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.globalissues.org/news/2026/11/25/44691&quot;&gt;Read the full story, “Will Bangladesh’s Islamists Reconcile with the Nation’s Cultural Identity?”, on globalissues.org&lt;/a&gt; →&lt;/p&gt;</summary></entry><entry><id>https://www.globalissues.org/news/2026/11/25/44689</id><title>Rejecting Demographic Arithmetic</title><updated>2026-11-25T11:40:25-08:00</updated><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://www.globalissues.org/news/2026/11/25/44689" /><link rel="enclosure" type="image/jpeg" href="https://static.globalissues.org/ips/2026/11/rejectingdemographicarithmeticcolumpio.jpg" /><media:content url="https://static.globalissues.org/ips/2026/11/rejectingdemographicarithmeticcolumpio.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" /><media:thumbnail url="https://static.globalissues.org/ips/2026/11/rejectingdemographicarithmeticcolumpio-100x100.jpg" width="100" height="100" /><summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://static.globalissues.org/ips/2026/11/rejectingdemographicarithmeticcolumpio.jpg&quot; width=&quot;640&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
